    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/eb4de2bd1fc4ac8d207b77ce16955e2b.poster.avif?t=1686307538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/eb4de2bd1fc4ac8d207b77ce16955e2b.webm?t=1686307538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/eb4de2bd1fc4ac8d207b77ce16955e2b.mp4?t=1686307538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> How it's meant to be played in the first place? Imagine you are impatiently waiting for pizza you ordered and need some distraction. This is it !  <br></li><li> Have you ever played old vertically scrolling shoot 'em ups but wanted<br>more? Then River Rush is a game for you.  <br></li><li> It's easy to start playing and easy to get to the next checkpoint (about 15 minutes).<br></li><li> An improved version of oldschool SHMUP games , like River Raid, 1940, Harrier Attack, Galaga etc.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/c66e6813549de84d4dcf3468bcf6c160.poster.avif?t=1686307538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/c66e6813549de84d4dcf3468bcf6c160.webm?t=1686307538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/c66e6813549de84d4dcf3468bcf6c160.mp4?t=1686307538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Survive by evading or destroying enemies. <br></li><li> Keep an eye on fuel and avoid terrain that is not river.<br></li><li> Your weapons for terminating enemies are laser bullets (like form old GI Joe and Transformers cartoons) plus rockets. <br></li><li> Rockets are fired with delay of 0.4 sec so you have to think ahead when to use them.<br></li><li> You move with WAD or Arrows. Fire bullets with Space and rockets with N<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/fb24d6aeea19d05e2234d8341ba7386d.poster.avif?t=1686307538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/fb24d6aeea19d05e2234d8341ba7386d.webm?t=1686307538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/fb24d6aeea19d05e2234d8341ba7386d.mp4?t=1686307538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> It has challenging gameplay, if you don't think ahead you'll get into mayhem from which it won't be easy to get out.<br></li><li> Enhanced pixel art experience from the 80es.<br></li><li> 13 types of enemies. Each needing a different approach.<br></li><li> No need for mouse, just keyboard.<br></li><li> Local leader board (like on old arcade machines, one per one PC).<br></li><li> Relive your youth. Or see what dad used to play :)</li></ul>",
