rockets. <br></li><li> Rockets are fired with delay of 0.4 sec so you have to think ahead when to use them.<br></li><li> You move with WAD or Arrows. Fire bullets with Space and rockets with N<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/fb24d6aeea19d05e2234d8341ba7386d.poster.avif?t=1686307538\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/fb24d6aeea19d05e2234d8341ba7386d.webm?t=1686307538\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1958350/extras/fb24d6aeea19d05e2234d8341ba7386d.mp4?t=1686307538\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> It has challenging gameplay, if you don't think ahead you'll get into mayhem from which it won't be easy to get out.<br></li><li> Enhanced pixel art experience from the 80es.<br></li><li> 13 types of enemies. Each needing a different approach.<br></li><li> No need for mouse, just keyboard.<br></li><li> Local leader board (like on old arcade machines, one per one PC).<br></li><li> Relive your youth. Or see what dad used to play :)</li></ul>",
